::ALG2_U03_L02_Q01::
Question ID:<br>ALG2_U03_L02_Q01<br><br>MLA Standard:<br>MLA.A2.RR.2<br><br>Question:<br>What is the domain of f(x) = &radic;(x - 4)? {
