::ALG2_U03_L02_Q04::
Question ID:<br>ALG2_U03_L02_Q04<br><br>MLA Standard:<br>MLA.A2.RR.2<br><br>Question:<br>Which function shifts f(x) = &radic;x left 5 units? {
